---
import SiteLayout from '../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Contact and project feedback — AISEOOnline"
  description="Find public feedback channels for AISEOOnline, understand what not to share, and see which contact details still require operator confirmation."
>
  <section class="page-banner">
    <div class="site-container max-w-4xl">
      <p class="eyebrow">Contact</p><h1 class="section-title mt-4">
        Share feedback without sharing secrets.
      </h1>
      <p class="page-intro">
        Help improve a checker by reporting reproducible problems, unclear explanations or missing
        documentation.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section-space">
    <div class="site-container max-w-3xl space-y-7 leading-8 text-slate-700">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">Public project issues</h2>
      <p>
        For ordinary technical bugs or suggestions, use the repository's <a
          class="inline-link"
          href="https://github.com/bharathumashankar/aiseoonline/issues/new/choose"
          >public GitHub issue templates</a
        >. Include the name of the tool, steps to reproduce and a non-sensitive example URL if
        possible.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Do not include</strong> passwords, session tokens, private crawl content, account details
        or sensitive URLs in a public issue. GitHub issues are visible to everyone.
      </p>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">Private or legal requests</h2>
      <p>
        A verified private contact method for privacy, security and legal requests has not yet been
        published. The operator must configure and review a secure contact address or form before
        live account onboarding. Public issues are not an appropriate substitute for confidential
        communication.
      </p>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">Response expectations</h2>
      <p>
        The project is maintained independently and does not promise a specific response time or
        guaranteed support. See the <a class="inline-link" href="/about/">project overview</a>, <a
          class="inline-link"
          href="/privacy/">privacy information</a
        > and <a class="inline-link" href="/terms/">usage terms</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
